<title>USA: Bank of NY seeks to invalidate Mass. ruling.</title>
<headline>Bank of NY seeks to invalidate Mass. ruling.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc said on Monday that it is filing a suit to invalidate a ruling by the Massachussetts Board of Bank Incorporation that denied its application to increase its investment in State Street Boston Corp.</p>
<p>Bank of New York said it was seeking to increase its stake in State Street to 9.9 percent.</p>
</text>
